  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sustainable Development Goals Performance Fund is a multi-donor pooled fund supporting the Government of Ethiopia&#x2019;s expansion of universal health care to all its citizens. It has significantly improved access to Primary Health Care services, particularly by the rural poor. These efforts have delivered lower child and maternal mortality rates, a decline in fertility rates and a significant increase in the number of women attending ante-natal care and giving birth at health facilities</narrative>
  </description>
